  "design_notes": [
    "Unmarked mineral-ceramic lifting body with a wrapped graphite thermal chine and two recessed stern bells.",
    "The pressure vessel, wing roots and cropped aerofoils share one continuous cross-section surface. The low canted tips follow the outboard chine.",
    "Two flight chairs, instrument coaming, shallow interior lining and aft service bulkhead surround the walkable deck. The interactive terminal and storage use separate level actors.",
    "Five separate laminated petrol-glass panels wrap under the rising graphite brow. Four structural posts, two on each side, support the continuous gasketed windshield.",
    "A broad graphite forecap rises across the nose cheeks below an ivory bridge. Its low-contrast expansion joints divide the heat shield into large tiles."
  ],
